{"seq":3,"slug":"automation-tooling","title":"自动化工具链","docCount":3,"url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"release-automation-tools","title":"发布自动化工具链","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/release-automation-tools","wordCount":1193,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"package-registry-management","title":"包注册中心与分发","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/package-registry-management","wordCount":1427,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"signing-provenance","title":"签名与来源证明","url":"/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/automation-tooling/signing-provenance","wordCount":1436,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 自动化工具链\n\n发布流程的可重复性依赖于工具链的自动化程度。本章从三个层面展开：首先是版本号推断与发布动作的端到端自动化工具（semantic-release、release-please 等）；其次是制品分发的基础设施——包注册中心的管理、镜像仓库的策略；最后是供应链安全层面的签名与来源证明，涵盖 Sigstore/cosign 的无密钥签名和 SLSA 构建来源证明框架。\n\n三篇文档回答\"用什么工具自动发\"、\"制品发到哪里去\"、\"消费者如何验证真伪\"。\n"}